## Architecture
`ContentView` owns the main `AppViewModel` and uses `selectedSidebarItem` for navigation. `AppViewModel.refresh` discovers projects, scans enabled projects, restores selected project if still enabled, or falls back to aggregate/all-project snapshot. Project preferences are separate UserDefaults records; app settings are another UserDefaults blob. Pi Agent sessions are persisted independently under Application Support and only reference projects by path.

